# QA test screen recordings — MP4s can be hundreds of MB and exceed
# GitHub's 100MB per-file limit, which blocks every push. Screenshots
# (PNG) remain committed as evidence; recordings stay local.
e2e-test-results/**/*.mp4

# FIX-Task-63 — the replay probe parks supabase/migrations here while it does a
# pristine reset, INSIDE the repo on purpose: a hold that survives a crash (a gate
# TIMEOUT, Ctrl-C, SIGKILL) must be visible and greppable, not hidden in os.tmpdir().
# The probe heals it automatically at startup, and `migration-gate.mjs --static`
# check S7 fails while it exists. Never commit it, and never `git clean` it away
# without recovering first: `node scripts/migrations/replay-probe.mjs --recover-hold`.
supabase/.migrations-hold/
